        "id": "code-recipe-coolify-vps-hardening-and-backup",
        "heading": "Playbook Recipe: Kịch bản khóa cứng VPS chạy Coolify (Chống Docker Bypass UFW, Khóa SSH & Sao lưu /data/coolify)",
        "language": "bash",
        "filename": "harden-coolify-vps.sh",
        "description": "Chạy trên máy chủ Ubuntu VPS trước/ngay sau khi cài Coolify: khóa đăng nhập SSH mật khẩu, cài ufw-docker chặn Docker lách tường lửa mở cổng DB (5432/6379), khóa cổng quản trị 8000 chỉ cho IP nội bộ/VPN và tạo cron sao lưu tệp bí mật .env cùng trạng thái /data/coolify.",
        "code": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nADMIN_VPN_IP=\"203.113.x.x/32\" # Thay bang IP tinh VPN hoac WireGuard cua doi ky thuat\n\n# 1. Khoa SSH: Cam dang nhap mat khau, chi cho phep SSH Public Key\nsed -i 's/^#*PasswordAuthentication.*/PasswordAuthentication no/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\nsed -i 's/^#*PubkeyAuthentication.*/PubkeyAuthentication yes/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\nsed -i 's/^#*PermitRootLogin.*/PermitRootLogin prohibit-password/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\nsshd -t && systemctl reload ssh\n\n# 2. Cai UFW + ufw-docker de ngan Docker tu y mo cong DB ra Internet\napt-get update && apt-get install -y ufw curl\nufw default deny incoming\nufw default allow outgoing\nufw allow 22/tcp\nufw allow 80/tcp\nufw allow 443/tcp\n# CHI cho phep VPN truy cap cong 8000 (hoac proxy qua Traefik HTTPS + Cloudflare Access)\nufw allow from \"${ADMIN_VPN_IP}\" to any port 8000 proto tcp\n\nwget -O /usr/local/bin/ufw-docker https://github.com/chaifeng/ufw-docker/raw/master/ufw-docker\nchmod +x /usr/local/bin/ufw-docker\nufw-docker install\nufw --force enable\nsystemctl restart ufw\n\n# 3. Tu dong sao luu /data/coolify (bao gom .env APP_KEY va DB trang thai Coolify) len S3 ma hoa\ncat << 'EOF' > /usr/local/bin/backup-coolify-state.sh\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\nSTAMP=$(date +%Y-%m-%d_%H%M)\nARCHIVE=\"/tmp/coolify-state-${STAMP}.tar.gz\"\ntar -czf \"${ARCHIVE}\" /data/coolify/source/.env /data/coolify/ssh /data/coolify/db\n# Day sang S3 bucket rieng (can cai rclone hoac awscli da cau hinh credentials)\nrclone copy \"${ARCHIVE}\" s3-sovereign:domation-infra-backups/coolify/\nrm -f \"${ARCHIVE}\"\nEOF\nchmod +x /usr/local/bin/backup-coolify-state.sh\n\necho \"Hardening hoan tat. Kiem tra: khong bao gio bat Public Port cho Postgres/Redis trong UI Coolify.\""
